    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Friendship is an important part of life, but not every child is good at making friends. That is OK. Making friends is a skill that can be learned. Here is some helpful advice."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h1",
        "type": "heading",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Build your conversational skills"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Learning how to have conversations with others is a skill that you will need. To start a conversation, you can use simple questions like “What do you do for fun?” or “Do you have any pets?”. Don’t ask questions that are too "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "private",
            "ref": "v-private"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h2",
        "type": "heading",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Work on your social skills"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Part of being a good friend is having good social skills. You need to learn to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "empathize",
            "ref": "v-empathize"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " with others. For example, you could make cookies for a child whose pet is sick. "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "Taking time to",
            "ref": "v-take-time-to"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " show someone that you care is a great way to make a new friend."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Don’t be sad if you don’t have many friends. Maybe that’s because you don’t have enough chances to meet them. Try to play with children who have similar hobbies. It is a great way to find new friends. With a little "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "practice",
            "ref": "v-practice"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and patience, you will soon have a friend or two."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
